verside Food Court because she was so personable, kind, hard-working and accommodating. I tasted the Salted Carmel and the regular Carmel and decided on the latter because I also had a Green Tea Latte which was WHOAAAA it was too strong for my taste but I was like a kid in a candy store with so many things to ..."},{"business_id":"Jk7abQBp7BTOt7c5F88Jwg","review_id":"zEGWZqe0_g7Pe_sIfhHX3w","date":"2017-11-06T03:06:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9291143417358398,"text_excerpt":"I always see Popcorn Bistro at Lakeside in Metairie but had never gotten around to trying it. Yesterday, I was strolling through Riverwalk looking for a snack and saw that there was another location there. I finally decided to give it a try, and I'm so happy I did because not only did the popcorn taste great, but I also had an overall great experience with the folks behind the counter. First off, I was so overwhelmed with all of the flavors and wanted to try each one. However, I also didn't want to be that person to ask for too many samples, so I ended up trying beignet and maple glazed butter pecan. The beignet popcorn was good, but it just tasted like powdered sugar. The maple glazed bu..."},{"business_id":"Jk7abQBp7BTOt7c5F88Jwg","review_id":"xgB_0SwmG8PaEI78-qsj9w","date":"2018-03-23T20:50:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9254499673843384,"text_excerpt":"So many choices and flavors to choose from!! This is popcorn heaven. Lol. I definitely tried my fair share of popcorn while there. I had to go with the Mardi Gras flavor this time because it seemed like the house favorite and hey it's NOLA baby!!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
